WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.9 · Strategic Foundations
Strategic objectives: external and internal

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Separate the change you want outside from the capabilities you need inside.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Use codes: ESO for external, ISO for internal.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Describe what success looks like at the end.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Give each objective one owner.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“ESO1: more Leeds residents repair and reuse instead of discarding. ISO3: volunteers trained in electrical safety.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write external and internal objectives, with codes and owners.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
